    "body": "I think what we want to do is to define **resolve** as having an optional argument |x| that defaults to undefined. See https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#algorithm-params for how to go about this.\n\nWe can then remove this step.\n\nThe one tricky thing is how to deal with type |T|. Maybe something like this:\n\n> To resolve a `Promise<T>` _p_, optionally with a value of type _T_ _value_:\n\nI don't really like \"_T_ _value_\" but it's hopefully clear enough.",
